    "chunk_text": "MY02A1 On \u00f0one \u00e6fterran d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s halgan biscopes gemynd Sancte Athanasi. MY02A2 He uu\u00e6s biscop in \u00f0\u00e6re miclan ceastre Alexandria. MY02A3 His halignes uu\u00e6s foretacnad on his cneahthade. MY02A3 \u00de\u00e6re burge biscop \u00e6r him w\u00e6s nemned Alexandre, se s\u00e6t sume symbeld\u00e6ge in \u00f0\u00e6re MY02A6 \u00dea ongon he fulwian \u00f0a o\u00feere cneahtas on \u00fe\u00e6s s\u00e6s y\u00feum, & hie eodan him under hond sua he MY02A7 & \u00f0a sona heht se biscop \u00feone cneht him to gel\u00e6dan, & hine l\u00e6rde gastlicne wisdom, & he MY03A1 On \u00f0one \u00feriddan d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 Sancte Alexandres \u00ferowung, \u00fe\u00e6s iungan papan, in MY03A4 \u00d0a Aurelianus se gesi\u00f0 se \u00f0\u00e6r cualde Cristene menn, \u00fea ongon he hie n\u00e6dan \u00f0\u00e6t hie Criste MY03A5 \u00d0a hie \u00f0\u00e6t ne ge\u00f0afodan, \u00fea heht he sendan hie alle \u00ferie in bernendne ofn. MY03A6 \u00dea nolde hie \u00f0\u00e6t fyr no b\u00e6rnan, \u00f0a heht he \u00f0a m\u00e6ssepreostas beheafdian & \u00feone papan MY03A7 \u00dea sona cuom stefn of heofonum & seo cu\u00e6\u00f0, Aurelianus, \u00f0eossum monnum \u00fee \u00f0u her MY03A9 \u00d0a sualt he sona \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan neaht mid egeslice dea\u00f0e, & his wiif, sio w\u00e6s on noman MY03A13 \u00d0es Sanctus Alexandre uu\u00e6s se fifta papa \u00e6fter Sancte Petre. MY",
